+config ALPINE_V2_ETH_HANDOFF
+	bool "Hand the al_eth board params and MAC address to Linux"
+	depends on PCI
+	default y
+	help
+	  Before entering Linux, make sure every integrated Ethernet function
+	  (PCI 1c36:0001) carries the "board params" scratch registers and
+	  the MAC address that the vendor al_eth driver reads at probe.
+	  Values the firmware left are kept; missing params come from the
+	  function's DT node (phy-mode, fixed-link), a missing MAC from env
